  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e8140d05737a11468020c371c32ff33, type: 3}
  m_Name: Resolve_FK_P07_07
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: AQ.App::AQ.App.CaseGraph
  startId: FK_P07_07_N1
  stageBackground: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b61e15d0a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e102, type: 3}
  nodes:
  - id: FK_P07_07_N1
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "I want to put some things in a row. They're all on the record, and every one of them is a question, not a claim."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P07_07_N2
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P07_07_N2
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "Brad Collins cleared his post office box at seven every working morning. The counter says the day's post is in the boxes before seven, and there has never been an afternoon sort."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P07_07_N3
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P07_07_N3
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "That Monday evening, by Liam's account, Brad said there'd been nothing in his box that morning, and it must have come in the afternoon sort."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P07_07_N4
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P07_07_N4
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "So either the one sort missed his box on that one day, or he had his key at seven and said he hadn't. I don't know which. Here's what else is true."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e02460f0c092dde4891723eecbbdc368, type: 3}
    emotion: 5
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P07_07_N5
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P07_07_N5
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "He argued Liam's side at that table every week and lost. The letter's one kindness is to him. And the panel this town watched her carry for a month is nowhere in that letter."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792b5f88f6dd2724d84b6954cc0b5fad, type: 3}
    emotion: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: FK_P07_07_N6
    choices: []
  - id: FK_P07_07_N6
    speaker: "Ally Quinn"
    line: "This isn't proof of anything. It's a question about a dead man that nobody asked while he was alive. If you saw Brad Collins anywhere on the morning the keys came, that Monday, write to me, not to anyone else."
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a6ca2348df1d653488455433cabdac99, type: 3}
    emotion: 2
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    waitForAudio: 0
    requiresFlag: 
    skipIfFlagMissing: 1
    setsFlag: 
    nextId: 
    choices: []
